#### Key Product Insights
- "You must vote to see results" creates FOMO and engagement
- Share cards show you voted but not what (mystery/intrigue)
- Frame as historical social experiment
- Make voting feel dramatic and important

#### User Flow Summary
1. Land on emoji.today → "Open in Farcaster"
2. Auth → Voting screen with thoughtful prompts
3. Confirmation screen emphasizing one vote per day
4. Success screen with share trigger
5. Results visible only after voting

